      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Chicago & Alton Railroad cut through the area in 1854, calling the depot Peoria Junction before a union station burned down during 1918 Armistice celebrations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
