      ],
      "source": "https://www.theroute-66.com/chenoa.html",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Scott’s original town lay west of the tracks, while Marshall’s competing East Chenoa occupied the east side, both laid out as orthogonal grids.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
